# Smart Returns Resolver — environment variables.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be committed.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenAI API key. This is the runtime LLM for all three pipeline
# calls — classifier, safety screener, responder — via `gpt-4o-mini`
# (see lib/llm/openai.ts, wired up in lib/engine/orchestrator.ts).
#
# Without it: lib/llm/openai.ts throws "OPENAI_API_KEY not set in
# .env.local" on the first call, /api/resolve returns HTTP 500, and
# the UI shows its generic "a team member will get back to you"
# fallback. The app builds and the page renders — nothing resolves.
#
# Cost: ~$0.005 per resolution (3 calls). The 15-case eval suite is
# well under $0.20 a run.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenRouter API key. NOT used at runtime. Only needed to re-run the
# multi-model prompt bake-offs in lib/llm/harness.ts and the
# lib/llm/test-*.ts scripts, which were used to iterate on prompts
# before the runtime switched to gpt-4o-mini.
#
# Without it: the app, the API and the eval suite all work normally.
# Only `npx tsx lib/llm/test-*.ts` fails.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
